        "text": "**A**: The pig is intelligent, informed, and consenting, and its wish isn't diminished by how it came about. Human upbringing also shapes our desires, and we don't usually say those desires don't count. I'd still feel uneasy about the engineering itself, but that's a question about how the pig was created, not about this meal.",
